About the Project

Restaurant Menu & Billing System is a simple C++ program that displays a restaurant menu with prices, allows customers to select food items and quantities, and automatically calculates the total bill.

Technology Used

- C++
- Conditional Statements
- Switch Statement
- Variables
- Input/Output

Features

- Restaurant menu card
- Food item selection
- Quantity selection
- Automatic bill calculation
- Simple and user-friendly interface